               <packagedElement xmi:id="cdi.Machine"
                                 xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#Machine"
                                 xmi:type="uml:Class">
                  <ownedComment xmi:id="cdi.Machine-ownedComment"
                                 xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#Machine-ownedComment"
                                 xmi:type="uml:Comment">
                     <body>Definition
============
Mechanism or computer program used to perform an act.

Examples
==========
SAS program, photocopier

Explanatory notes
===================
May be used as a target to identify the agent who performed an action. Used to define hardware or software that act as agents in data capture, data processing, or other related actions.</body>
