                              xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#Conceptual-ownedComment"
                              xmi:type="uml:Comment">
                  <body>This package contains the classes in the DDI-CDI Library which define foundational metadata constructs at the conceptual level. This includes not only the primary definitional class in the model - Concept - but also many of its significant applications: variables, units (of interest, not of measurement), universes, and categories, along with supporting constructs.
Many of these classes are reused in other packages for specific purposes.</body>
