               <packagedElement xmi:id="cdi.ConceptSystem"
                                 xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#ConceptSystem"
                                 xmi:type="uml:Class">
                  <ownedComment xmi:id="cdi.ConceptSystem-ownedComment"
                                 xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#ConceptSystem-ownedComment"
                                 xmi:type="uml:Comment">
                     <body>Definition
============
Set of concepts structured by the relations among them [GSIM 1.1].

Examples
==========
1) Concept of Sex: Male, Female, Other. 
2) Concept of Household Relationship: Household Head, Spouse of Household Head, Child of Household Head, Unrelated Household Member, etc.

Explanatory notes
===================
Note that this class can be used with concepts, classifications, universes, populations, unit types and any other class that extends from concept.</body>
