                     <body>Definition
============
Structure for describing the complex relationships between statistical classifications in a classification series.

Examples
==========
A classification series that branches into separately versioned classifications.

Explanatory notes
===================
Can use relation specification information to more fully describe the relationship between members such as parent/child, whole/part, general/specific, equivalence, etc.</body>
