Examples
==========
ISCO-08: index='1' label of associated category 'Major', index='2' label of associated category 'Sub-Major',  index='3' label of associated category 'Minor', 

Explanatory notes
===================
Provides level information for the members of the level structure. levelNumber provides the level number which may or may not be associated with a category which defines level.</body>
