               <packagedElement xmi:id="cdi.CombinedDate"
                                 xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#CombinedDate"
                                 xmi:type="uml:DataType">
                  <ownedComment xmi:id="cdi.CombinedDate-ownedComment"
                                 xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#CombinedDate-ownedComment"
                                 xmi:type="uml:Comment">
                     <body>Definition
============
Provides the structure of a single Date expressed in an ISO date structure along with equivalent expression in any number of non-ISO formats. While it supports the use of the ISO time interval structure this should only be used when the exact date is unclear (i.e. occurring at some point in time between the two specified dates) or in specified applications. Ranges with specified start and end dates should use the DateRange as a datatype. Commonly uses property names include: eventDate, issueDate, and releaseDate.

Explanatory notes
===================
Date allows one of a set of date-time (YYYY-MM-DDThh:mm:ss), date (YYYY-MM-DD), year-month (YYYY-MM), year (YYYY), time (hh:mm:ss) and duration (PnYnMnDnHnMnS), or time interval (YYYY-MM-DDThh:mm:ss/YYYY-MM-DDThh:mm:ss, YYYY-MM-DDThh:mm:ss/PnYnMnDnHnMnS, PnYnMnDnHnMnS/ YYYY-MM-DDThh:mm:ss) which is formatted according to ISO 8601 and backed supported by regular expressions in the BaseDateType. Time Zone designation and negative/positive prefixes are allowed as are dates before and after 0000 through 9999.</body>
                     <annotatedElement xmi:idref="cdi.CombinedDate"/>
                  </ownedComment>
                  <name>CombinedDate</name>
                  <ownedAttribute xmi:id="cdi.CombinedDate-isoDate"
                                   xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#CombinedDate-isoDate"
                                   xmi:type="uml:Property">
                     <name>isoDate</name>
                     <type xmi:idref="cdi.XsdDate"/>
                     <lowerValue xmi:id="cdi.CombinedDate-isoDate-lowerValue"
                                  xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#CombinedDate-isoDate-lowerValue"
                                  xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger">
                        <value>0</value>
                     </lowerValue>
                  </ownedAttribute>
                  <ownedAttribute xmi:id="cdi.CombinedDate-nonIsoDate"
                                   xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#CombinedDate-nonIsoDate"
                                   xmi:type="uml:Property">
                     <name>nonIsoDate</name>
                     <type xmi:idref="cdi.NonIsoDate"/>
                     <lowerValue xmi:id="cdi.CombinedDate-nonIsoDate-lowerValue"
                                  xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#CombinedDate-nonIsoDate-lowerValue"
                                  xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger">
                        <value>0</value>
                     </lowerValue>
                     <upperValue xmi:id="cdi.CombinedDate-nonIsoDate-upperValue"
                                  xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#CombinedDate-nonIsoDate-upperValue"
                                  xmi:type="uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural">
                        <value>*</value>
                     </upperValue>
                  </ownedAttribute>
                  <ownedAttribute xmi:id="cdi.CombinedDate-semantics"
                                   xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#CombinedDate-semantics"
                                   xmi:type="uml:Property">
                     <name>semantics</name>
                     <type xmi:idref="cdi.ControlledVocabularyEntry"/>
                     <lowerValue xmi:id="cdi.CombinedDate-semantics-lowerValue"
                                  xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#CombinedDate-semantics-lowerValue"
                                  xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger">
                        <value>0</value>
                     </lowerValue>
                  </ownedAttribute>
               </packagedElement>
               <packagedElement xmi:id="cdi.Command"
                                 xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#Command"
                                 xmi:type="uml:DataType">
                  <ownedComment xmi:id="cdi.Command-ownedComment"
                                 xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#Command-ownedComment"
                                 xmi:type="uml:Comment">
                     <body>Definition
============
Provides the following information on the command: The content of the command and the programming language used.

</body>
                     <annotatedElement xmi:idref="cdi.Command"/>
                  </ownedComment>
                  <name>Command</name>
                  <ownedAttribute xmi:id="cdi.Command-commandContent"
                                   xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#Command-commandContent"
                                   xmi:type="uml:Property">
                     <name>commandContent</name>
                     <type xmi:idref="cdi.TypedString"/>
                     <lowerValue xmi:id="cdi.Command-commandContent-lowerValue"
                                  xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#Command-commandContent-lowerValue"
                                  xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger">
                        <value>0</value>
                     </lowerValue>
                  </ownedAttribute>
                  <ownedAttribute xmi:id="cdi.Command-programLanguage"
                                   xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#Command-programLanguage"
                                   xmi:type="uml:Property">
                     <name>programLanguage</name>
                     <type xmi:idref="cdi.ControlledVocabularyEntry"/>
                     <lowerValue xmi:id="cdi.Command-programLanguage-lowerValue"
                                  xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#Command-programLanguage-lowerValue"
                                  xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger">
                        <value>0</value>
                     </lowerValue>
                  </ownedAttribute>
               </packagedElement>
               <packagedElement xmi:id="cdi.CommandCode"
                                 xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#CommandCode"
                                 xmi:type="uml:DataType">
                  <ownedComment xmi:id="cdi.CommandCode-ownedComment"
                                 xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#CommandCode-ownedComment"
                                 xmi:type="uml:Comment">
                     <body>Definition
============
Contains information on the command used for processing data. Contains a description of the command which should clarify for the user the purpose and process of the command, an in-line provision of the command itself, and a reference to an external version of the command such as a coding script. 

</body>
                     <annotatedElement xmi:idref="cdi.CommandCode"/>
                  </ownedComment>
                  <name>CommandCode</name>
                  <ownedAttribute xmi:id="cdi.CommandCode-command"
                                   xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#CommandCode-command"
                                   xmi:type="uml:Property">
                     <name>command</name>
                     <type xmi:idref="cdi.Command"/>
                     <lowerValue xmi:id="cdi.CommandCode-command-lowerValue"
                                  xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#CommandCode-command-lowerValue"
                                  xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger">
                        <value>0</value>
                     </lowerValue>
                     <upperValue xmi:id="cdi.CommandCode-command-upperValue"
                                  xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#CommandCode-command-upperValue"
                                  xmi:type="uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural">
                        <value>*</value>
                     </upperValue>
                  </ownedAttribute>
                  <ownedAttribute xmi:id="cdi.CommandCode-commandFile"
                                   xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#CommandCode-commandFile"
                                   xmi:type="uml:Property">
                     <name>commandFile</name>
                     <type xmi:idref="cdi.CommandFile"/>
                     <lowerValue xmi:id="cdi.CommandCode-commandFile-lowerValue"
                                  xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#CommandCode-commandFile-lowerValue"
                                  xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger">
                        <value>0</value>
                     </lowerValue>
                     <upperValue xmi:id="cdi.CommandCode-commandFile-upperValue"
                                  xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#CommandCode-commandFile-upperValue"
                                  xmi:type="uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural">
                        <value>*</value>
                     </upperValue>
                  </ownedAttribute>
                  <ownedAttribute xmi:id="cdi.CommandCode-description"
                                   xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#CommandCode-description"
                                   xmi:type="uml:Property">
                     <name>description</name>
                     <type xmi:idref="cdi.InternationalString"/>
                     <lowerValue xmi:id="cdi.CommandCode-description-lowerValue"
                                  xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#CommandCode-description-lowerValue"
                                  xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger">
                        <value>0</value>
                     </lowerValue>
                  </ownedAttribute>
               </packagedElement>
               <packagedElement xmi:id="cdi.CommandFile"
                                 xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#CommandFile"
                                 xmi:type="uml:DataType">
                  <ownedComment xmi:id="cdi.CommandFile-ownedComment"
                                 xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#CommandFile-ownedComment"
                                 xmi:type="uml:Comment">
                     <body>Definition
============
Identifies and provides a link to an external copy of the command, for example, a SAS Command Code script. Designates the programming language of the command file, a description of the location of the file , and a URN or URL for the command file.

</body>
                     <annotatedElement xmi:idref="cdi.CommandFile"/>
                  </ownedComment>
                  <name>CommandFile</name>
                  <ownedAttribute xmi:id="cdi.CommandFile-location"
                                   xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#CommandFile-location"
                                   xmi:type="uml:Property">
                     <name>location</name>
                     <type xmi:idref="cdi.InternationalString"/>
                     <lowerValue xmi:id="cdi.CommandFile-location-lowerValue"
                                  xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#CommandFile-location-lowerValue"
                                  xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger">
                        <value>0</value>
                     </lowerValue>
                  </ownedAttribute>
                  <ownedAttribute xmi:id="cdi.CommandFile-uri"
                                   xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#CommandFile-uri"
                                   xmi:type="uml:Property">
                     <name>uri</name>
                     <type xmi:idref="cdi.XsdAnyUri"/>
                     <lowerValue xmi:id="cdi.CommandFile-uri-lowerValue"
                                  xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#CommandFile-uri-lowerValue"
                                  xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger">
                        <value>0</value>
                     </lowerValue>
                  </ownedAttribute>
               </packagedElement>
               <packagedElement xmi:id="cdi.ContactInformation"
                                 xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#ContactInformation"
                                 xmi:type="uml:DataType">
                  <ownedComment xmi:id="cdi.ContactInformation-ownedComment"
                                 xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#ContactInformation-ownedComment"
                                 xmi:type="uml:Comment">
                     <body>Definition
============
Contact information for the individual or organization including location specification, address, web site, phone numbers, and other means of communication access. Address, location, telephone, and other means of communication can be repeated to express multiple means of a single type or change over time. Each major piece of contact information contains the element effectiveDates in order to date stamp the period for which the information is valid.

</body>
                     <annotatedElement xmi:idref="cdi.ContactInformation"/>
                  </ownedComment>
                  <name>ContactInformation</name>
                  <ownedAttribute xmi:id="cdi.ContactInformation-address"
                                   xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#ContactInformation-address"
                                   xmi:type="uml:Property">
                     <name>address</name>
                     <type xmi:idref="cdi.Address"/>
                     <lowerValue xmi:id="cdi.ContactInformation-address-lowerValue"
                                  xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#ContactInformation-address-lowerValue"
                                  xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger">
                        <value>0</value>
                     </lowerValue>
                     <upperValue xmi:id="cdi.ContactInformation-address-upperValue"
                                  xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#ContactInformation-address-upperValue"
                                  xmi:type="uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural">
                        <value>*</value>
                     </upperValue>
                  </ownedAttribute>
                  <ownedAttribute xmi:id="cdi.ContactInformation-email"
                                   xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#ContactInformation-email"
                                   xmi:type="uml:Property">
                     <name>email</name>
                     <type xmi:idref="cdi.Email"/>
                     <lowerValue xmi:id="cdi.ContactInformation-email-lowerValue"
                                  xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#ContactInformation-email-lowerValue"
                                  xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger">
                        <value>0</value>
                     </lowerValue>
                     <upperValue xmi:id="cdi.ContactInformation-email-upperValue"
                                  xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#ContactInformation-email-upperValue"
                                  xmi:type="uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural">
                        <value>*</value>
                     </upperValue>
                  </ownedAttribute>
                  <ownedAttribute xmi:id="cdi.ContactInformation-emessaging"
                                   xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#ContactInformation-emessaging"
                                   xmi:type="uml:Property">
                     <name>emessaging</name>
                     <type xmi:idref="cdi.ElectronicMessageSystem"/>
                     <lowerValue xmi:id="cdi.ContactInformation-emessaging-lowerValue"
                                  xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#ContactInformation-emessaging-lowerValue"
                                  xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger">
                        <value>0</value>
                     </lowerValue>
                     <upperValue xmi:id="cdi.ContactInformation-emessaging-upperValue"
                                  xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#ContactInformation-emessaging-upperValue"
                                  xmi:type="uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural">
                        <value>*</value>
                     </upperValue>
                  </ownedAttribute>
                  <ownedAttribute xmi:id="cdi.ContactInformation-telephone"
                                   xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#ContactInformation-telephone"
                                   xmi:type="uml:Property">
                     <name>telephone</name>
                     <type xmi:idref="cdi.Telephone"/>
                     <lowerValue xmi:id="cdi.ContactInformation-telephone-lowerValue"
                                  xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#ContactInformation-telephone-lowerValue"
                                  xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger">
                        <value>0</value>
                     </lowerValue>
                     <upperValue xmi:id="cdi.ContactInformation-telephone-upperValue"
                                  xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#ContactInformation-telephone-upperValue"
                                  xmi:type="uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural">
                        <value>*</value>
                     </upperValue>
                  </ownedAttribute>
                  <ownedAttribute xmi:id="cdi.ContactInformation-website"
                                   xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#ContactInformation-website"
                                   xmi:type="uml:Property">
                     <name>website</name>
                     <type xmi:idref="cdi.WebLink"/>
                     <lowerValue xmi:id="cdi.ContactInformation-website-lowerValue"
                                  xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#ContactInformation-website-lowerValue"
                                  xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger">
                        <value>0</value>
                     </lowerValue>
                     <upperValue xmi:id="cdi.ContactInformation-website-upperValue"
                                  xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#ContactInformation-website-upperValue"
                                  xmi:type="uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural">
                        <value>*</value>
                     </upperValue>
                  </ownedAttribute>
               </packagedElement>
               <packagedElement xmi:id="cdi.ControlledVocabularyEntry"
                                 xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#ControlledVocabularyEntry"
                                 xmi:type="uml:DataType">
                  <ownedComment xmi:id="cdi.ControlledVocabularyEntry-ownedComment"
                                 xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#ControlledVocabularyEntry-ownedComment"
                                 xmi:type="uml:Comment">
                     <body>Definition
============
Allows for unstructured content which may be an entry from an externally maintained controlled vocabulary.If the content is from a controlled vocabulary provide the code value of the entry, as well as a reference to the controlled vocabulary from which the value is taken. Provide as many of the identifying attributes as needed to adequately identify the controlled vocabulary. Note that DDI has published a number of controlled vocabularies applicable to several locations using the external controlled vocabulary entry structure. If the code portion of the controlled vocabulary entry is language specific (i.e. a list of keywords or subject headings) use language to specify that language. In most cases the code portion of an entry is not language specific although the description and usage may be managed in one or more languages. Use of shared controlled vocabularies helps support interoperability and machine actionability.

</body>
                     <annotatedElement xmi:idref="cdi.ControlledVocabularyEntry"/>
                  </ownedComment>
                  <name>ControlledVocabularyEntry</name>
                  <ownedAttribute xmi:id="cdi.ControlledVocabularyEntry-entryReference"
                                   xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#ControlledVocabularyEntry-entryReference"
                                   xmi:type="uml:Property">
                     <name>entryReference</name>
                     <type xmi:idref="cdi.Reference"/>
                     <lowerValue xmi:id="cdi.ControlledVocabularyEntry-entryReference-lowerValue"
                                  xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#ControlledVocabularyEntry-entryReference-lowerValue"
                                  xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger">
                        <value>0</value>
                     </lowerValue>
                     <upperValue xmi:id="cdi.ControlledVocabularyEntry-entryReference-upperValue"
                                  xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#ControlledVocabularyEntry-entryReference-upperValue"
                                  xmi:type="uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural">
                        <value>*</value>
                     </upperValue>
                  </ownedAttribute>
                  <ownedAttribute xmi:id="cdi.ControlledVocabularyEntry-entryValue"
                                   xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#ControlledVocabularyEntry-entryValue"
                                   xmi:type="uml:Property">
                     <name>entryValue</name>
                     <type xmi:type="uml:PrimitiveType"
                            href="http://www.eclipse.org/uml2/5.0.0/UML/PrimitiveTypes.xmi#String"/>
                     <lowerValue xmi:id="cdi.ControlledVocabularyEntry-entryValue-lowerValue"
                                  xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#ControlledVocabularyEntry-entryValue-lowerValue"
                                  xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger">
                        <value>0</value>
                     </lowerValue>
                     <upperValue xmi:id="cdi.ControlledVocabularyEntry-entryValue-upperValue"
                                  xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#ControlledVocabularyEntry-entryValue-upperValue"
                                  xmi:type="uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural">
                        <value>*</value>
                     </upperValue>
                  </ownedAttribute>
                  <ownedAttribute xmi:id="cdi.ControlledVocabularyEntry-name"
                                   xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#ControlledVocabularyEntry-name"
                                   xmi:type="uml:Property">
                     <name>name</name>
                     <type xmi:type="uml:PrimitiveType"
                            href="http://www.eclipse.org/uml2/5.0.0/UML/PrimitiveTypes.xmi#String"/>
                     <lowerValue xmi:id="cdi.ControlledVocabularyEntry-name-lowerValue"
                                  xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#ControlledVocabularyEntry-name-lowerValue"
                                  xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger">
                        <value>0</value>
                     </lowerValue>
                  </ownedAttribute>
                  <ownedAttribute xmi:id="cdi.ControlledVocabularyEntry-valueForOther"
                                   xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#ControlledVocabularyEntry-valueForOther"
                                   xmi:type="uml:Property">
                     <name>valueForOther</name>
                     <type xmi:type="uml:PrimitiveType"
                            href="http://www.eclipse.org/uml2/5.0.0/UML/PrimitiveTypes.xmi#String"/>
                     <lowerValue xmi:id="cdi.ControlledVocabularyEntry-valueForOther-lowerValue"
                                  xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#ControlledVocabularyEntry-valueForOther-lowerValue"
                                  xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger">
                        <value>0</value>
                     </lowerValue>
                  </ownedAttribute>
                  <ownedAttribute xmi:id="cdi.ControlledVocabularyEntry-vocabulary"
                                   xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#ControlledVocabularyEntry-vocabulary"
                                   xmi:type="uml:Property">
                     <name>vocabulary</name>
                     <type xmi:idref="cdi.Reference"/>
                     <lowerValue xmi:id="cdi.ControlledVocabularyEntry-vocabulary-lowerValue"
                                  xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#ControlledVocabularyEntry-vocabulary-lowerValue"
                                  xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger">
                        <value>0</value>
                     </lowerValue>
                  </ownedAttribute>
               </packagedElement>
               <packagedElement xmi:id="cdi.CorrespondenceDefinition"
                                 xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#CorrespondenceDefinition"
                                 xmi:type="uml:DataType">
                  <ownedComment xmi:id="cdi.CorrespondenceDefinition-ownedComment"
                                 xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#CorrespondenceDefinition-ownedComment"
                                 xmi:type="uml:Comment">
                     <body>Definition
============
Describes the commonalities and differences between two members using a textual description of both commonalities and differences plus an optional coding of the type of commonality.

</body>
                     <annotatedElement xmi:idref="cdi.CorrespondenceDefinition"/>
                  </ownedComment>
                  <name>CorrespondenceDefinition</name>
                  <ownedAttribute xmi:id="cdi.CorrespondenceDefinition-commonality"
                                   xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#CorrespondenceDefinition-commonality"
                                   xmi:type="uml:Property">
                     <name>commonality</name>
                     <type xmi:idref="cdi.InternationalString"/>
