               <packagedElement xmi:id="cdi.InternationalIdentifier"
                                 xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#InternationalIdentifier"
                                 xmi:type="uml:DataType">
                  <ownedComment xmi:id="cdi.InternationalIdentifier-ownedComment"
                                 xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#InternationalIdentifier-ownedComment"
                                 xmi:type="uml:Comment">
                     <body>Definition
============
An identifier whose scope of uniqueness is broader than the local archive. Common forms of an international identifier are ISBN, ISSN, DOI or similar designator. Provides both the value of the identifier and the agency who manages it.

Explanatory notes
===================
For use in annotation or other citation format. 


</body>
                     <annotatedElement xmi:idref="cdi.InternationalIdentifier"/>
                  </ownedComment>
                  <name>InternationalIdentifier</name>
                  <ownedAttribute xmi:id="cdi.InternationalIdentifier-identifierContent"
                                   xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#InternationalIdentifier-identifierContent"
                                   xmi:type="uml:Property">
                     <name>identifierContent</name>
                     <type xmi:type="uml:PrimitiveType"
                            href="http://www.eclipse.org/uml2/5.0.0/UML/PrimitiveTypes.xmi#String"/>
                     <lowerValue xmi:id="cdi.InternationalIdentifier-identifierContent-lowerValue"
                                  xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#InternationalIdentifier-identifierContent-lowerValue"
                                  xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger">
                        <value>0</value>
                     </lowerValue>
                  </ownedAttribute>
                  <ownedAttribute xmi:id="cdi.InternationalIdentifier-isURI"
                                   xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#InternationalIdentifier-isURI"
                                   xmi:type="uml:Property">
                     <name>isURI</name>
                     <type xmi:type="uml:PrimitiveType"
                            href="http://www.eclipse.org/uml2/5.0.0/UML/PrimitiveTypes.xmi#Boolean"/>
                     <lowerValue xmi:id="cdi.InternationalIdentifier-isURI-lowerValue"
                                  xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#InternationalIdentifier-isURI-lowerValue"
                                  xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger">
                        <value>0</value>
                     </lowerValue>
                     <defaultValue xmi:id="cdi.InternationalIdentifier-isURI-defaultValue"
                                    xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#InternationalIdentifier-isURI-defaultValue"
                                    xmi:type="uml:LiteralBoolean">
                        <value>False</value>
                     </defaultValue>
                  </ownedAttribute>
                  <ownedAttribute xmi:id="cdi.InternationalIdentifier-managingAgency"
                                   xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#InternationalIdentifier-managingAgency"
                                   xmi:type="uml:Property">
                     <name>managingAgency</name>
                     <type xmi:idref="cdi.ControlledVocabularyEntry"/>
                     <lowerValue xmi:id="cdi.InternationalIdentifier-managingAgency-lowerValue"
                                  xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#InternationalIdentifier-managingAgency-lowerValue"
                                  xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger">
                        <value>0</value>
                     </lowerValue>
                  </ownedAttribute>
               </packagedElement>
               <packagedElement xmi:id="cdi.InternationalRegistrationDataIdentifier"
                                 xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#InternationalRegistrationDataIdentifier"
                                 xmi:type="uml:DataType">
                  <ownedComment xmi:id="cdi.InternationalRegistrationDataIdentifier-ownedComment"
                                 xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#InternationalRegistrationDataIdentifier-ownedComment"
                                 xmi:type="uml:Comment">
                     <body>Definition
==========
Persistent, globally unique object identifier aligned with ISO/IEC 11179-6:2015, Information technology - Metadata registries (MDR) - Part 6: Registration, Annex A, Identifiers based on ISO/IEC 6523, http://standards.iso.org/ittf/PubliclyAvailableStandards/c060342_ISO_IEC_11179-6_2015.zip.
The uniqueness of an InternationalRegistrationDataIdentifier (IRDI) is determined by the combination of the values of three identifying attributes.</body>
                     <annotatedElement xmi:idref="cdi.InternationalRegistrationDataIdentifier"/>
                  </ownedComment>
                  <name>InternationalRegistrationDataIdentifier</name>
                  <ownedAttribute xmi:id="cdi.InternationalRegistrationDataIdentifier-dataIdentifier"
                                   xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#InternationalRegistrationDataIdentifier-dataIdentifier"
                                   xmi:type="uml:Property">
                     <name>dataIdentifier</name>
                     <type xmi:type="uml:PrimitiveType"
                            href="http://www.eclipse.org/uml2/5.0.0/UML/PrimitiveTypes.xmi#String"/>
                  </ownedAttribute>
                  <ownedAttribute xmi:id="cdi.InternationalRegistrationDataIdentifier-registrationAuthorityIdentifier"
                                   xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#InternationalRegistrationDataIdentifier-registrationAuthorityIdentifier"
                                   xmi:type="uml:Property">
                     <name>registrationAuthorityIdentifier</name>
                     <type xmi:type="uml:PrimitiveType"
                            href="http://www.eclipse.org/uml2/5.0.0/UML/PrimitiveTypes.xmi#String"/>
                  </ownedAttribute>
                  <ownedAttribute xmi:id="cdi.InternationalRegistrationDataIdentifier-versionIdentifier"
                                   xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#InternationalRegistrationDataIdentifier-versionIdentifier"
                                   xmi:type="uml:Property">
                     <name>versionIdentifier</name>
                     <type xmi:type="uml:PrimitiveType"
                            href="http://www.eclipse.org/uml2/5.0.0/UML/PrimitiveTypes.xmi#String"/>
                  </ownedAttribute>
               </packagedElement>
               <packagedElement xmi:id="cdi.InternationalString"
                                 xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#InternationalString"
                                 xmi:type="uml:DataType">
                  <ownedComment xmi:id="cdi.InternationalString-ownedComment"
                                 xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#InternationalString-ownedComment"
                                 xmi:type="uml:Comment">
                     <body>Definition
============
Packaging structure for multilingual versions of the same string content, represented by a set of LanguageString. Only one LanguageString per language/scope type is allowed. Where an element of this type (InternationalString) is repeatable, the expectation is that each repetition contains a different content, each of which can be expressed in multiple languages.</body>
                     <annotatedElement xmi:idref="cdi.InternationalString"/>
                  </ownedComment>
                  <name>InternationalString</name>
                  <ownedAttribute xmi:id="cdi.InternationalString-languageSpecificString"
                                   xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#InternationalString-languageSpecificString"
                                   xmi:type="uml:Property">
                     <name>languageSpecificString</name>
                     <type xmi:idref="cdi.LanguageString"/>
                     <lowerValue xmi:id="cdi.InternationalString-languageSpecificString-lowerValue"
                                  xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#InternationalString-languageSpecificString-lowerValue"
                                  xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger">
                        <value>0</value>
                     </lowerValue>
                     <upperValue xmi:id="cdi.InternationalString-languageSpecificString-upperValue"
                                  xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#InternationalString-languageSpecificString-upperValue"
                                  xmi:type="uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural">
                        <value>*</value>
                     </upperValue>
                  </ownedAttribute>
               </packagedElement>
               <packagedElement xmi:id="cdi.LabelForDisplay"
                                 xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#LabelForDisplay"
                                 xmi:type="uml:DataType">
                  <ownedComment xmi:id="cdi.LabelForDisplay-ownedComment"
                                 xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#LabelForDisplay-ownedComment"
                                 xmi:type="uml:Comment">
                     <body>Definition
============
A structured display label. Label provides display content of a fully human readable display for the identification of the object. 

</body>
                     <annotatedElement xmi:idref="cdi.LabelForDisplay"/>
                  </ownedComment>
                  <name>LabelForDisplay</name>
                  <ownedAttribute xmi:id="cdi.LabelForDisplay-locationVariant"
                                   xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#LabelForDisplay-locationVariant"
                                   xmi:type="uml:Property">
                     <name>locationVariant</name>
                     <type xmi:idref="cdi.ControlledVocabularyEntry"/>
                     <lowerValue xmi:id="cdi.LabelForDisplay-locationVariant-lowerValue"
                                  xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#LabelForDisplay-locationVariant-lowerValue"
                                  xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger">
                        <value>0</value>
                     </lowerValue>
                  </ownedAttribute>
                  <ownedAttribute xmi:id="cdi.LabelForDisplay-maxLength"
