               <packagedElement xmi:id="cdi.ObjectName"
                                 xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#ObjectName"
                                 xmi:type="uml:DataType">
                  <ownedComment xmi:id="cdi.ObjectName-ownedComment"
                                 xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#ObjectName-ownedComment"
                                 xmi:type="uml:Comment">
                     <body>Definition
==========
A standard means of expressing a name for a class object. A linguistic signifier. Human understandable name (word, phrase, or mnemonic) that reflects the ISO/IEC 11179-5 naming principles.

Explanatory notes
=================
Use in model: In general the property name should be "name" as it is the name of the class object of which it is an attribute. Use a specific name (i.e. xxxName) only when naming something other than the class object of which it is an attribute.</body>
                     <annotatedElement xmi:idref="cdi.ObjectName"/>
                  </ownedComment>
                  <name>ObjectName</name>
                  <ownedAttribute xmi:id="cdi.ObjectName-context"
                                   xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#ObjectName-context"
                                   xmi:type="uml:Property">
                     <name>context</name>
                     <type xmi:idref="cdi.ControlledVocabularyEntry"/>
                     <lowerValue xmi:id="cdi.ObjectName-context-lowerValue"
                                  xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#ObjectName-context-lowerValue"
                                  xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger">
                        <value>0</value>
                     </lowerValue>
                  </ownedAttribute>
                  <ownedAttribute xmi:id="cdi.ObjectName-name"
                                   xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#ObjectName-name"
                                   xmi:type="uml:Property">
                     <name>name</name>
                     <type xmi:type="uml:PrimitiveType"
                            href="http://www.eclipse.org/uml2/5.0.0/UML/PrimitiveTypes.xmi#String"/>
                     <lowerValue xmi:id="cdi.ObjectName-name-lowerValue"
                                  xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#ObjectName-name-lowerValue"
                                  xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger">
                        <value>0</value>
                     </lowerValue>
                  </ownedAttribute>
               </packagedElement>
               <packagedElement xmi:id="cdi.OrganizationName"
                                 xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#OrganizationName"
                                 xmi:type="uml:DataType">
                  <ownedComment xmi:id="cdi.OrganizationName-ownedComment"
                                 xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#OrganizationName-ownedComment"
                                 xmi:type="uml:Comment">
                     <body>Definition
==========
Names by which the organization is known. Use the attribute isFormal with a value of True to designate the legal or formal name of the organization. Names may be typed with typeOfOrganizationName to indicate their appropriate usage.</body>
                     <annotatedElement xmi:idref="cdi.OrganizationName"/>
                  </ownedComment>
                  <name>OrganizationName</name>
                  <ownedAttribute xmi:id="cdi.OrganizationName-abbreviation"
                                   xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#OrganizationName-abbreviation"
                                   xmi:type="uml:Property">
                     <name>abbreviation</name>
                     <type xmi:idref="cdi.InternationalString"/>
                     <lowerValue xmi:id="cdi.OrganizationName-abbreviation-lowerValue"
                                  xmi:uuid="https://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CDI/1.0/#OrganizationName-abbreviation-lowerValue"
                                  xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger">
                        <value>0</value>
                     </lowerValue>
                  </ownedAttribute>
